<title>SPAIN: CNMV cancels Radiotronica trade suspension.</title>
<headline>CNMV cancels Radiotronica trade suspension.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Stock Market Commission CNMV said on Monday it was cancelling a suspension that had been imposed on trading in the shares of Radiotronica last Friday following a mandatory disclosure by the company.</p>
<p>The electronic equipment group said last Friday that its activities had been badly hit by high costs and a slump in sales which would force it to dismiss 652 workers.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
